Supervisor --> UC_Notifications
Supervisor --> UC_ReadNotifications
Supervisor --> UC_Education
Supervisor --> UC_TransportResources
Supervisor --> UC_Routes
Supervisor --> UC_Assignments
Supervisor --> UC_Schedules
Supervisor --> UC_Calendar
Supervisor --> UC_TripLifecycle
Supervisor --> UC_Attendance
Supervisor --> UC_ReportIncident
Supervisor --> UC_ManageIncidents
Supervisor --> UC_Monitor
Supervisor --> UC_Reports
Supervisor --> UC_Audit
Supervisor --> UC_Settings

Driver --> UC_Login
Driver --> UC_Forgot
Driver --> UC_Profile
